---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article>
    <h1>About me</h1>

    <section class="bio">
      <p>
        I am Abhirath, and I like to keep my curiosity alive. Across the last 10 years, I have worked as a product manager/ leader and a management consultant across companies of all sizes. I find the world very fascinating and like tinkering.  
      <p>
        This site is an attempt to bring my multiple interests to life. Views expressed here are personal.
      </p>
      <p class="socials">
        Find me on <a href="https://x.com/trendingchariot" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/abhirathsharma/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Books I liked recently</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Humanise by Thomas Heatherwick</li>
        <li>The Pinnacle, a novel by Abir Mukherjee</li>
        <li>Messy by Tim Harford</li>
        <li>Made to Stick by Chip Heath and Dan Heath</li>
        <li>Narrative Economics by Robert Shiller</li>
        <li>Empire of Pain by Patrick Radden Keefe</li>
        <li>What Went Wrong with Capitalism by Ruchir Sharma</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  article {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .bio p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .socials {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .date {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  ul {
    margin-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
</style>
